  {
   "type": "explain",
   "task": "Listen and read.",
   "taskAudio": "../../en-shared/q/listen-and-read.mp3",
   "book": "lesson",
   "items": [
    {
     "pics": [
      "../../pics/al-u5l2-s1.jpg"
     ],
     "lines": [
      {
       "t": "At Miniature World, in New York, US, you can see 40 different countries in one day. It isn't an amusement park, it's a model world. Each model shows a place or a neighborhood in a town or city.",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/at-miniature-world-in-new-york-us-you-can-see-40-d-ba745737.mp3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "page": 106
  },
  {
   "type": "explain",
   "task": "Listen and read.",
   "taskAudio": "../../en-shared/q/listen-and-read.mp3",
   "book": "lesson",
   "items": [
    {
     "pics": [
      "../../pics/al-u5l2-s1.jpg"
     ],
     "lines": [
      {
       "t": "This is Berlin, in Germany. The tall building is the TV Tower. It's behind the houses.",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/this-is-berlin-in-germany-the-tall-building-is-the-a9a57920.mp3"
      },
      {
       "t": "On the right, there is another monument called the Brandenburg Gate. In front of the TV Tower is a big wheel. It's in a pretty square.",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/on-the-right-there-is-another-monument-called-the-b2c7ae85.mp3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "page": 106
  },
  {
   "type": "explain",
   "task": "Listen and read.",
   "taskAudio": "../../en-shared/q/listen-and-read.mp3",
   "book": "lesson",
   "items": [
    {
     "pics": [
      "../../pics/al-u5l2-s2.jpg"
     ],
     "lines": [
      {
       "t": "This place is called the Taj Mahal. It's in Agra, India. There are four gardens in front of the Taj Mahal. The gardens are between two walls. The walls are opposite each other.",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/this-place-is-called-the-taj-mahal-it-s-in-agra-in-349dd011.mp3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "page": 107
  },
  {
   "type": "explain",
   "task": "Listen and read.",
   "taskAudio": "../../en-shared/q/listen-and-read.mp3",
   "book": "lesson",
   "items": [
    {
     "pics": [
      "../../pics/al-u5l2-s3.jpg"
     ],
     "lines": [
      {
       "t": "You can see people everywhere at Miniature World! Find them in coffee shops, stations, and markets. Or see them sit and play games in the park. Look at the people in a big station in New York City, US. Look at the people in the park in Paris, France.",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/you-can-see-people-everywhere-at-miniature-world-f-db989f45.mp3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "page": 107
  },
  {
   "type": "explain",
   "task": "Listen and read.",
   "taskAudio": "../../en-shared/q/listen-and-read.mp3",
   "book": "lesson",
   "items": [
    {
     "pics": [
      "../../pics/al-u5l2-s3.jpg"
     ],
     "lines": [
      {
       "t": "Many of the places and monuments are real. There are also fun things to look for and do! You can find your favorite characters from TV. Then you can make a model of yourself. You can put yourself in a place you want to be!",
       "a": "../../en-shared/q/many-of-the-places-and-monuments-are-real-there-ar-287c7e83.mp3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "page": 107
  },
